3	// End-to-end regression coverage for `reviews submit` spec intake. The
4	// review submission, whether read from a file or standard input, must be
5	// exactly one complete JSON object: a stray '}' or ']', a second object or
6	// any other non-whitespace content after the closing brace must fail the
7	// whole command through stderr (exit 1, no success JSON on stdout), leave
